# DevSecOps Pipeline — Security Ignorelist for Trivy
# Each entry MUST have a documented justification comment

# ── Format ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# CVE-XXXX-XXXXX  # <date> <reason> <owner>
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# EXAMPLE entries (remove before production use):
# CVE-2023-44487   # 2024-01-15 | HTTP/2 rapid reset — mitigated at WAF layer | security@example.com
# CVE-2024-21626   # 2024-02-01 | runc CVE — distroless image not affected | devops@example.com
